[{"id":3835467726,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7knJfO","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm not the best suited to review the code in `JoltSoftBody3D::_create_shared_settings_volume`, so consider this a shallow first pass review I guess.\n\nWhen just testing it out with some of the procedural (subdivided) meshes available in Godot I'm seeing quite a bit of jank, like vertices/faces coming loose and jittery/unstable simulations, which I'm not sure what to attribute to.\n\nI get the sense that there may be some stringent requirements for what the topology of the mesh needs to look like?\n\nAlso, for whatever reason, changing the `soft_body_form` property to \"Volume\" in the editor stalls the process for several seconds with even simple meshes, even though running the game itself is quick.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116570#pullrequestreview-3835467726","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116570","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116570#pullrequestreview-3835467726